+## Candidate 035 supervised-withdrawal duties
+
+The receiver has no SELECT on regulated_governance_rosters_v1. Candidate 035
+restores the adopted 033 restriction after reviewing the 034 widening. Retention
+holds its shared advisory lock on the receiver transaction and reads roster rows
+through the configured governor. The installation-scope obligation stays OPEN.
+The governor also reads regulated_reviews_v1 and reference_epoch_withdrawal_receipts_v1,
+and inserts the latter only through the owned withdrawal transaction. These
